                        "entry_id": "c01c2359-e9a5-3cd9-ad53-a7c05e941e06",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any of several types of trees having edible fruit:",
                            "Mountain pawpaw (Vasconcellea pubescens), a fruit tree native to South America."
